  "title": "Upload an Object",
  "description": "When you upload a file to QStorage, it is stored as an object. Objects consist of the file data and metadata that describes the object. You can have an unlimited number of objects in a bucket. Before you can upload files to a QStorage bucket, you need write permissions for the bucket.",
